{"id":51628,"date":"2026-06-11T15:43:08","date_gmt":"2026-06-11T14:43:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51628"},"modified":"2026-09-23T11:01:16","modified_gmt":"2026-09-23T10:01:16","slug":"prime-hybrid-espinho-fitness-racing","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/prime-hybrid-espinho-fitness-racing\/","title":{"rendered":"Prime Hybrid Espinho Fitness Racing 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Prime Hybrid Espinho Fitness Racing 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Prime Hybrid Espinho Fitness Racing 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>26 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong> no emblem\u00e1tico cen\u00e1rio costeiro da cidade de <strong>Espinho<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Promovido com elevado rigor pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Desempenho e Resili\u00eancia (ADDR)<\/strong>, o evento afirma-se como uma das competi\u00e7\u00f5es de fitness racing ao ar livre mais aguardadas do calend\u00e1rio desportivo nacional, desafiando os atletas a testarem a sua for\u00e7a, resist\u00eancia cardiovascular e tenacidade psicol\u00f3gica num circuito 100% urbano.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com centro nevr\u00e1lgico e arena funcional (RoxZone) concentrados na <strong>Pra\u00e7a Progresso<\/strong> e percurso de corrida estendido \u00e0 <strong>Avenida 8<\/strong>, a prova segue a din\u00e2mica oficial de <strong>8 segmentos de corrida de 1.000 m (duas voltas de 500 m)<\/strong> intercalados com <strong>8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais de alta intensidade<\/strong> (SkiErg, Sled Push, Sled Pull, Burpee Broad Jump, Remo, Farmer&#8217;s Carry, Sandbag Lunges e Wall Balls). O programa contempla divis\u00f5es <strong>Singles (Open e Pro)<\/strong>, <strong>Doubles (Open, Pro e Mistos no formato You Go, I Go)<\/strong> e a inspiradora <strong>Liga Associativa<\/strong> (para Bombeiros, PSP, For\u00e7as Armadas e coletividades locais), estando a participa\u00e7\u00e3o limitada a 1.000 atletas com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica e 27 pr\u00e9mios de p\u00f3dio em disputa.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 07:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pra\u00e7a Progresso e Avenida 8, Espinho, Aveiro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8 km de Corrida urbana (8x 1.000m) intercalados com 8 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es Funcionais<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Desempenho e Resili\u00eancia (ADDR)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Secretariado das 07:00 \u00e0s 18:00 com Heats escalonadas<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.primehybrid.pt\/pdf\/regulamento-prime-hybrid-v4.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Fitness Racing<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Singles (Open &#038; Pro)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 07:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Fitness Racing Duplas<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Doubles (Open, Pro &#038; Mistos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: Heats Tarde<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Liga Associativa<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Liga Associativa (Entidades &#038; Clubes)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: Heats Finais<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Prime Hybrid Espinho Fitness Racing 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre no s\u00e1bado, 26 de Setembro de 2026, com arena central montada na Pra\u00e7a Progresso e circuito de corrida ao longo da Avenida 8, em Espinho.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a estrutura de prova e exerc\u00edcios do Prime Hybrid?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova cumpre uma ordem fixa composta por 8 km de corrida total (8 voltas de 1.000 m) intercalados com 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais: SkiErg (1.000m), Sled Push (4&#215;12,5m), Sled Pull (4&#215;12,5m), Burpee Broad Jump (80m), Row (1.000m), Farmer&#8217;s Carry (200m), Sandbag Lunges (100m) e Wall Balls (100 repeti\u00e7\u00f5es).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as divis\u00f5es competitivas dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas podem competir em formato individual Singles (divis\u00f5es Open e Pro, masculino e feminino), em duplas Doubles (Open Men, Open Women, Open Mixed, Pro Men e Pro Women) ou atrav\u00e9s da Liga Associativa para entidades e coletividades locais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as regras na categoria de Doubles?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na categoria Doubles, a corrida de 1.000 m \u00e9 cumprida obrigatoriamente em conjunto (sem afastamento superior a 10 metros), enquanto as esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais s\u00e3o executadas no formato You Go, I Go (YGIG), com altern\u00e2ncia livre entre os dois parceiros.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e qual o prazo de check-in?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na Pra\u00e7a Progresso (piso inferior) entre as 07:00 e as 18:00, devendo o check-in ser conclu\u00eddo impreterivelmente at\u00e9 60 minutos antes da heat atribu\u00edda a cada atleta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Prime Hybrid Espinho Fitness Racing 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a Progresso e Avenida 8, Espinho\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Espinho\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Desempenho e Resili\u00eancia (ADDR)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Prime Hybrid Espinho Fitness Racing 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre no s\u00e1bado, 26 de Setembro de 2026, com arena central montada na Pra\u00e7a Progresso e circuito de corrida ao longo da Avenida 8, em Espinho.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a estrutura de prova e exerc\u00edcios do Prime Hybrid?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova cumpre uma ordem fixa composta por 8 km de corrida total (8 voltas de 1.000 m) intercalados com 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais: SkiErg (1.000m), Sled Push (4x12,5m), Sled Pull (4x12,5m), Burpee Broad Jump (80m), Row (1.000m), Farmer's Carry (200m), Sandbag Lunges (100m) e Wall Balls (100 repeti\u00e7\u00f5es).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as divis\u00f5es competitivas dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os atletas podem competir em formato individual Singles (divis\u00f5es Open e Pro, masculino e feminino), em duplas Doubles (Open Men, Open Women, Open Mixed, Pro Men e Pro Women) ou atrav\u00e9s da Liga Associativa para entidades e coletividades locais.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as regras na categoria de Doubles?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na categoria Doubles, a corrida de 1.000 m \u00e9 cumprida obrigatoriamente em conjunto (sem afastamento superior a 10 metros), enquanto as esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais s\u00e3o executadas no formato You Go, I Go (YGIG), com altern\u00e2ncia livre entre os dois parceiros.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde funciona o secretariado e qual o prazo de check-in?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona na Pra\u00e7a Progresso (piso inferior) entre as 07:00 e as 18:00, devendo o check-in ser conclu\u00eddo impreterivelmente at\u00e9 60 minutos antes da heat atribu\u00edda a cada atleta.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66795,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,1455],"event_type_2